			"notes": "Refactored a bunch of internals, overall the Annotater class is now much more pleasant to use: instances can be created at any time regardless of GL context (constructor is preferred now).  \nAlso added texture labeling, and a hook on TextureManager that labels every registered texture with its identifier.  \nRemoved the thread aware stuff as it turned out to be irrelevant to the profiler hooks (its only user)."
		},
